  "sourceTitle": "Easy Mango Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Easy Mango Salsa\nBy: Greg Radcliffe\nPublished: Friday, May 8, 2015 - 6:34am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 mangos\n1/2 red pepper, diced\n1 jalapeño, finely diced\nJuice from 1 lime\nCilantro, 1-2 tsp.\n1 small shallot, finely diced\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cut up mango 2 Add in your other ingredients 3 Mix\n\nAbout\n\nFresh and light, this mango salsa is great as an appetizer or as a topping for tacos. And best of all, it's delicious and really easy to make.",
